Cell["\<\
The REAL interaction is not the one we wrote in the first place, nor the one \
with \[Chi](x)-\[Chi](y)! The real interaction is \
\>", "Text",
 CellChangeTimes->{{3.951972396780592*^9, 3.951972414306528*^9}, {
  3.9519726467851925`*^9, 3.951972661560749*^9}, {3.9520736155219975`*^9, 
